<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="preload" as="image" href="/public/images/top-image.jpg">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/public/images/favicon.svg">
  <title>recomte.ru | 404 - Страница не найдена</title>
  
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/bulma.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
  <style>
    html, body {
      height: 100%;
    }
    
    body {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    header {
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .error-container {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
    }

    .error-content h1 {
      font-size: 5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .error-content p {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }

    .error-content .button {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    footer {
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="section" style="padding: 2rem 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="title is-2 mb-1"><a href="/" style="text-decoration: none;"><img src="/public/images/favicons/favicon-orange-512x512.png" alt="" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: middle;">Recomte</a></h1>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="error-container">
  <div class="error-content">
    <h1>404</h1>
    <p>Страница не найдена</p>
    <p class="is-size-6">Возможно, эта страница была перемещена или удалена.</p>
    <a href="/" class="button is-light is-medium">
      <span class="icon">
        <i class="fas fa-home"></i>
      </span>
      <span>Вернуться на главную</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="footer has-background-light">
  <div class="content has-text-centered">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Recomte.ru</p>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
